      },
      "text": "Section 1. Establishment of the Board. There is established effective July\n19, 1996, a Board of three members to be appointed by the President to\ninvestigate this dispute. No member shall be pecuniarily or otherwise inter-\nested in any organization of railroad employees or any carrier. The Board\nshall perform its functions subject to the availability of funds."
    },
    {
      "char_end": 2087,
      "char_start": 1972,
      "id": "CLAUSES:EO:13012#sec2",
      "kind": "section",
      "label": "Sec. 2.",
