        "url": "https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-1996-07-23/pdf/96-18846.pdf"
      },
      "text": "Sec. 3. Maintaining Conditions. As provided by Section 9A(c) of the Act,\nfrom the date of the creation of the Board and for 120 days thereafter,\nno change, except by agreement of the parties, shall be made by the carrier\nor the employees in the conditions out of which the dispute arose."
    },
